    </div>

    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>Who needs an ACR I-Card?</summary>
        <p>Generally, holders of long-term Philippine visas, and tourist-visa holders whose stay extends beyond a short-term period. Tell us your visa status and we'll confirm whether it applies to you.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens if I lose my ACR I-Card?</summary>
